  "details": "# Issue:\n\nWhen adjusting the dolly path we currently can pickup a node and move it by hand. This how ever causes a few issues, like doing accidental rotation changes (especially roll). These can often times end up causing the camera path to look weird.\n\n# Suggestion:\n\nAdd pitch, yaw and roll controls to the camera nodes. Doing so would allow us to do small adjustments on nodes and correct mistakes that were made when moving it.\n\nAdditionally adding a lock button for each axis could also help mitigating accidental pitch / yaw / roll changes.",
